// The executable's own icon: Explorer, the taskbar and the Start menu read it
// straight out of the binary, and Qt takes the window icon from it too.
// Windows has no icon theme to look the SVG up in.
//
// Numbered 1 because the shell shows the lowest-numbered icon resource.
// The path is absolute because rc.exe and windres disagree on what a relative
// one is relative to. Forward slashes: both accept them, and a backslash would
// need escaping.
1 ICON "@SIMUPY_ICO_PATH@"
